~ enable session-band@thismoon
  $ {HOME}/bin/claude plugin enable session-band@thismoon --scope user
~ update session-band@thismoon (0.1.0 -> 0.2.0)
  $ {HOME}/bin/claude plugin update session-band@thismoon --scope user
applied 2 changes; new sessions or /reload-plugins pick them up; updated mods load after a restart
